### Highest-value findings
1. **`bridgeCoversPending` fails on Hyperliquid Bridge** — validators can over-subscribe pending withdrawals; code only checks per-request/per-finalize.
2. **Vocabulary collapses** — `Ob` covers AMM / proven CLOB / consensus CLOB / no-book pool; `Wq` covers censorship deadline vs dispute vs epoch waterfall; `Ix` covers HWM vs stream vs implicit ratio; `Sh` covers NAV / par / irredeemable wrap.
3. **No symbol for** permanent escrow (cvxCRV), rate-limit envelope (Spark), desert mode (Lighter), position impact pool (GMX), strategy-debt map (Yearn).
4. **Code vs profile** — ApeX repo is AMM-perp not zkLink omni; Hyperliquid open source is bridge-only; Spark clone is ALM controller not sUSDS.
5. **Profile-only** (no clone): Aster, edgeX, Jupiter Perp, CIAN, Steakhouse.
